<title>USA: United Video Satellite Q4 shr rises.</title>
<headline>United Video Satellite Q4 shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>TULSA, Okla. 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>(in thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>	  Quarter Ended December 31,    Year Ended December 31,</p>
<p>		    1996    1995  %Change  1996     1995  %Change</p>
<p> Revenues	 $130,701 $79,050   65% $437,168 $262,919  66%</p>
<p> Net income	  7,506   6,147   22%   30,084   23,172  30%</p>
<p>Earnings per share,</p>
<p>exclusive of</p>
<p>non-recurring</p>
<p>   charges	    0.24    0.19   26%     0.89     0.72  24%</p>
<p>Earnings per share</p>
<p>			  0.20    0.17   18%     0.81     0.63  29%</p>
<p>Common and common</p>
<p>equivalent shares</p>
<p>   outstanding    36,947  36,594   ---   37,020   36,571  ---</p>
<p>NOTE: Full company name is United Video Satellite Group Inc.</p>
<p>Earnings for Q4 1996 include a downward revision of the company's SSDS unit's EBITBA resulting from revised cost estimates on contracts during the first three quarters of 1996 of $1.7 million ($2.5 million before minority interests), the company said.</p>
</text>
